[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12902.229, "timestamp": "03:35:02", "text": "什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12904.63, "timestamp": "03:35:04", "text": "既然你是螺旋桨，那么……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12906.79, "timestamp": "03:35:06", "text": "你也做不了什么。现在，如果你想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12908.71, "timestamp": "03:35:08", "text": "存活，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12912.15, "timestamp": "03:35:12", "text": "鼻子向下。直接摔倒在地。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12915.67, "timestamp": "03:35:15", "text": "好的。它正朝我袭来，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12918.95, "timestamp": "03:35:18", "text": "不，还没有。现在，导弹"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12922.75, "timestamp": "03:35:22", "text": "会在你到达之前到达你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12925.03, "timestamp": "03:35:25", "text": "地面。我得等你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12927.55, "timestamp": "03:35:27", "text": "到达"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12930.55, "timestamp": "03:35:30", "text": "地面。你是往下走还是往上走？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12933.75, "timestamp": "03:35:33", "text": "我应该下去吗？好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12937.11, "timestamp": "03:35:37", "text": "嘿，你想活下去吗？是的。我可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12938.71, "timestamp": "03:35:38", "text": "我只是转过身，把鼻子指向前方，然后……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12946.95, "timestamp": "03:35:46", "text": "范围。所以，有一句非常好的谚语"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12949.429, "timestamp": "03:35:49", "text": "在飞行员中，飞上去炸毁。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12952.229, "timestamp": "03:35:52", "text": "必须遵守那句谚语。下去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12955.03, "timestamp": "03:35:55", "text": "救救自己。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12956.229, "timestamp": "03:35:56", "text": "嗯，我不知道那种情况是什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12959.83, "timestamp": "03:35:59", "text": "确实可以省钱，但这有点……"}]